      "en": "When the LORD brought back those who returned to Zion, we were like those who dream.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 시온의 포로를 돌리실 때에 우리가 꿈꾸는 것 같았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "f485da3e759367d7ed4754e8b91d6588d52c8be1c7ec2bdc1e6c74393027f48e",
      "translation_text_hash": "285d58f04aa7d4ce633964f97356922085f67a76b5f4f00349ba3168848da83b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 시온의 포로를 돌리실 때에 우리가 꿈꾸는 것 같았도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "285d58f04aa7d4ce633964f97356922085f67a76b5f4f00349ba3168848da83b"
      ]
