      "en": "He who goes out weeping, carrying seed for sowing, will certainly come again with joy, carrying his sheaves.",
      "ko": "울며 씨를 뿌리러 나가는 자는 정녕 기쁨으로 그 단을 가지고 돌아오리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "babe12043bdfeba4ac003df0a8c9a902cc5bac83887479a18f354ededcf8d823",
      "translation_text_hash": "668263776a44a953af62799389073d6917fc94321522fa67ffcef9a7bf987a50",
